          "id": 7581943,
          "ident": "pkg_3399286_7581943",
          "name": "Battle Pass",
          "slug": null,
          "description": "<p>⭐ CHROMA PASS - SEASON 2: SHARDFALL</p>\n<p>You keep every Free Pass reward and retroactively unlock the Chroma reward on every tier you've already passed.</p>\n<p>Unlocks the premium reward track on the ChromaBit Pass for Season 2.</p>\n<p>50 tiers, and every single tier pays out. You also keep claiming the free</p>\n<p>track, so everything below is what you walk away with.</p>\n<p>THE CRUX - TIER 50</p>\n<p>Chromatic Spear - the Season 2 signature weapon, and the only way to get it.</p>\n<p>Ships finished with Sharpness 7, Lunge 3, Knockback 2, Looting 4, Unbreaking 3,</p>\n<p>Mending, Prismdrain and Chromabound.</p>\n<p>Comes with a Warden Spawner, 3x Chroma Key and $1,000,000.</p>\n<p>CRATE KEYS</p>\n<p>23x Chroma Key</p>\n<p>24x Spawner Key</p>\n<p>23x Shard Key</p>\n<p>SPAWNERS - 47 IN TOTAL</p>\n<p>Warden, Shulker, 3x Wither Skeleton, Evoker, Ghast, 3x Enderman, 3x Blaze,</p>\n<p>Iron Golem, Copper Golem, Breeze, Guardian, Witch, Magma Cube, Slime, Drowned,</p>\n<p>Creeper, Cave Spider, Spider, 4x Skeleton, 4x Zombie, and a starter farm</p>\n<p>set of chickens, cows and rabbits.</p>\n<p>SHARDS - HELD IN THE OFF HAND</p>\n<p>Shard of Strength (mythic)</p>\n<p>Shard of Haste (legendary)</p>\n<p>Shard of Embers (epic)</p>\n<p>Shard of Night (rare)</p>\n<p>ENCHANTMENTS</p>\n<p>Telepathy IV</p>\n<p>Vein Miner III</p>\n<p>Lifesteal IV</p>\n<p>Double Strike III</p>\n<p>Soulbound III</p>\n<p>Plus 5 random books - Fabled, Legendary, Ultimate and Elite.</p>\n<p>ENCHANTING UTILITY</p>\n<p>4x White Scroll</p>\n<p>Scroll of Binding</p>\n<p>Transmog Scroll</p>\n<p>2x StatTrak</p>\n<p>ARMOUR TRIMS</p>\n<p>All 18 vanilla trim patterns, handed out in pairs across the season:</p>\n<p>Coast, Sentry, Dune, Wild, Ward, Wayfinder, Eye, Vex, Tide, Snout, Rib,</p>\n<p>Spire, Shaper, Silence, Raiser, Host, Flow and Bolt.</p>\n<p>IN GAME CURENCY AND EXTRAS</p>\n<p>$1,500,000 total</p>\n<p>Elytra</p>\n<p>Beacon</p>\n<p>+25% Points Booster for 24 hours</p>\n