          "name": "Chroma Key",
          "slug": null,
          "description": "<p>- One Chroma Key that can be used to open the Chroma Crate at spawn!<br />\n<strong>Chroma Crate grants [1x] of the following rewards:</strong><br />\n ◈ CHROMA</p>\n<p>- Chromatic Sword</p>\n<p>◈  MYTHIC</p>\n<p>- Chromatic Helmet</p>\n<p>- Chromatic Chestplate</p>\n<p>- Chromatic Leggings</p>\n<p>- Chromatic Boots</p>\n<p>- Chromatic Elytra</p>\n<p>- $750,000</p>\n<p>- Chroma Key x3</p>\n<p>◈  LEGENDARY</p>\n<p>- Chromatic Pickaxe</p>\n<p>- Chromatic Axe</p>\n<p>- Chromatic Shovel</p>\n<p>- $600,000</p>\n<p>- Chroma Key x2</p>\n<p>◈  EPIC</p>\n<p>- Corrupted Helmet</p>\n<p>- Corrupted Chestplate</p>\n<p>- Corrupted Leggings</p>\n<p>- Corrupted Boots</p>\n<p>- Corrupted Blade</p>\n<p>- Corrupted Elytra</p>\n<p>- $500,000</p>\n<p>- Chroma Key</p>\n<p>◈ RARE</p>\n<p>- Elytra</p>\n<p>- Corrupted Pickaxe</p>\n<p>- Corrupted Axe</p>\n<p>- Corrupted Shovel</p>\n<p>- $400,000</p>\n<p>- Mending Book</p>\n<p>- Netherite Ingot x2</p>\n<p>UNCOMMON — 26.9%</p>\n<p>- $300,000</p>\n<p>- Netherite Scrap x3</p>\n<p>- Efficiency V Book</p>\n<p>- Fortune III Book</p>\n<p>- Diamond Block x4</p>\n<p>◈ COMMON</p>\n<p>- $250,000</p>\n<p>- Heavy Core</p>\n<p>- All 18 Armor Trims — Sentry, Dune, Coast, Wild, Ward, Eye, Vex, Tide, Snout, Rib, Spire, Wayfinder, Shaper, Silence, Raiser, Host, Flow, Bolt</p>\n",
