        {
          "id": 7620947,
          "ident": "pkg_3385106_7620947",
          "name": "Shard Key",
          "slug": null,
          "description": "<p>Shards are minerals you carry in your off hand for a passive effect that</p>\n<p>lasts as long as you hold them. No cooldowns, no charges, no right-clicking - put it in the slot and it works.</p>\n<p><strong>THE 12 SHARDS</strong></p>\n<p>Shard of Strength      Strength II</p>\n<p>Shard of Haste         Haste II</p>\n<p>Shard of Swiftness     Speed II</p>\n<p>Shard of Vitality      Absorption II</p>\n<p>Shard of Vigor         Health Boost II</p>\n<p>Shard of Healing       Regeneration I</p>\n<p>Shard of Embers        Fire Resistance</p>\n<p>Shard of the Tides     Water Breathing + Dolphin's Grace</p>\n<p>Shard of Night         Night Vision</p>\n<p>Shard of the Feather   Slow Falling</p>\n<p>Shard of Hunger        Saturation</p>\n<p>Shard of Luck          Luck</p>\n<p>ALSO INSIDE</p>\n<p>Scrolls of Binding - apply to any weapon, tool or armor piece and you will never lose it on death.</p>\n<p>Stat Trackers - BlockTrak, StatTrak, MobTrak and FishTrak. Apply one and your gear starts counting blocks mined, players killed, mobs killed or fish caught.</p>\n<p>MILESTONES</p>\n<p>A free Shard Key every 10 opens.</p>\n<p>A guaranteed Shard of Strength every 40 opens.</p>\n<p>Both milestones repeat, and they track across every key you ever open.</p>\n",
